WEBVTT

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.300
What are you doing?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.890
Who said you could walk
around the ship on your own?!

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:46.640
You should feel privileged you
can take such leisurely strolls.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:51.150
Meanwhile, here I am, repairing
your unit without any time to sleep.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.880
A little appreciation
would be nice to have.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.720
Emily.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.400
You think you're such
a big shot, Union traitor!

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.170
We have our own way of fighting!

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:21.580
Meaning we have no need for your help!

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:44.480
Back Turned to Peace

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.610
That girl!

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:54.940
Do I have to pound it into
her head once and for all?!

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:59.220
Oh, my. There goes Lottie again.
What is this, the seventh time?

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.450
Eighth.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:04.390
Both the Queen and Sara
just never learn...

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.380
Do you suppose
Sara-san will be all right?

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.900
Gutsy Girl!

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:26.070
Good work, Emily.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.510
What was that simulation just now?!

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:34.050
How many times do I have to
tell you to stay in my formation?!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.220
If I hadn't taken the lead then,
we wouldn't have downed the targets.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.620
Say what?!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:44.130
Listen! This formation uses one unit
as a decoy to lure out the enemy

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.600
so the other unit can go
bang-bang to destroy them!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.730
Zoom, bang-bang!

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.730
Zoom! Bang-bang!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.540
And if they start going boom-boom,
we switch to zap-zap-zap!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:57.740
Hey, you! I'm not done talking!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.730
Gutsy Girl! Get back here!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:05.740
Urgh! You're always
such a pain in the ass!

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.190
She really is the same as always!

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:17.450
In that case, I'll tame
her with my charm!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.040
What do you think?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.110
It was too nice of a scene
for me to pass up...

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:35.040
It came out pretty well,
if I do say so myself.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:38.650
This is actually one of
the very few talents he has!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.720
I could do without the "very few" part!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:43.320
Whatcha drawing?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.590
A space monster?

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:48.820
You idiot! Don't be stupid!
Of course she's not drawing a-

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.430
An abstract drawing?

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.490
It's Emily's clothes...

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.260
If you don't need anything,
I'll be going now.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.580
Just when it seemed like
things were going to go well!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.080
You just had to call it
a space monster, didn't you?!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.910
Well, you called it an abstract drawing!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.020
You should just forget about her!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.460
She's gutsy enough
to vie with the Queen!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.190
--You don't stand a chance!
--Leave me alone!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.360
From the Queen?

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:38.140
That right actuator isn't-

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:40.510
--Yeah, I know!
--Say, Emily.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:45.480
What do you think of Lottie?
I kind of can't stand her...

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:49.790
She wasn't too much today, but
she's really hot-blooded sometimes.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.490
People like her never
used to bother me,

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:55.720
but I'm amazed Jessie can
stand following her around.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.390
Weird girls attract
weird friends, I guess.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.000
Martha is always recommending meat,

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.040
and Ermy's always
prattling on about diets.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.240
I don't even think she needs
to diet, to be honest.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.070
Oh, yeah!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.180
Carris and Dickon are such jerks!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.990
They called my drawing
a space monster! Isn't that rude?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.660
After all that hard work I did
drawing a new outfit for you.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:29.090
See? Isn't it cute?

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.600
What's this?! What do you guys want?!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.970
I see the place is as filthy as ever.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:41.100
But a little tidying up should
provide us enough room!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.540
Yes!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.840
Hey, now! What are you talking about?!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.680
Why are you invading my
sanctuary without permission?!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.210
Okay!

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:56.120
We, the Spatial Armor Division,
will now hold our party here!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.590
Huh?!

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.520
Party?

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.990
All members of the Spatial Armor
Division will be attending!

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.790
You, there! That means you'll
be attending too, naturally!

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.120
Umm...

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.970
This party is for all of us!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:13.840
It is not a specific person's
welcome party!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.800
There's no escape this time!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.910
Oh! I see! So that's what this is about!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.150
You're that happy
my Strain started up?!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.080
Yes! You have promising qualities!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.380
--I'm so moved!
--No, that's not really-

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:32.420
Alright! If you admire me that much,
there's only one thing to do!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.980
I'll give you a helping hand!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.900
Eat! Drink! Be merry!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:51.200
--Now you're talking!
--All the meat you can eat!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.840
Drink up!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:05.620
All this is is a bother...

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.650
Right, Emily?

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:14.530
If only you could talk...

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:22.910
"2nd Strain Start-Up Party!!"

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:20.400
I hereby officially begin
my 2nd Strain Start-Up Party!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.370
When I look back now, my first
encounter with a Strain was when-

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.610
They're not gonna like your
long speeches, you know!

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.680
Shut up, Carmichael!

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:31.850
Ever since I was a young child,
I was revered as a brilliant prodigy.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:35.220
--At the age of two...
--I heard from Lin-chan
of the Engineering Division

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.220
that he goes on for a long time...

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.620
Hi, Sara-san!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.660
What do you think? Cute, huh?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:48.100
Come, Sara-san! Let's have a
private welcome party in my room!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.900
What is this?! What are you doing?!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.970
Are you having a party here?!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:56.470
--Oh, come to think of it...
--We forgot to tell Lavinia...

00:07:56.470 --> 00:08:01.340
H-how terrible! Holding a party without
telling someone is just terrible!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.140
Eh?!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.490
Okay! In that case!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.080
Cheers!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:42.950
I'll never forget what happened
after the Fifth Homeros War!

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:47.220
--My incredible versatility as a...
--Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.690
Say, do I really not have
much of a presence?

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.660
Don't sweat the details!
Have some meat!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.990
Oh, leave me alone!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:01.240
Ermy-chan!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:05.070
C'mon, stop sticking with the girls
and come over and talk with me!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.810
Geez, you're promiscuous, Dickon.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.180
I can't help it!
Girls are my purpose in life!

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.850
Being called your purpose
in life isn't so bad...

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:15.880
Right?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:19.690
--Ouch!
--But yeah, you're just not my type.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:23.630
--Sorry.
--That's cold! C'mon! Wait!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:27.530
--He never learns.
--That's for sure.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.100
Get me some more, Jessie.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.330
Sure thing!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.270
Why the glum look?

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:43.550
People can die at any time,
so you gotta have fun when you can!

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:45.150
What're you looking at?

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:47.380
Oh. Gutsy Girl...

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.040
Sara. Her name is Sara.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:55.090
Looks like even she can smile.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.930
--Go on!
--Eh?

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:59.030
Don't leave her all alone! Go!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.690
S-shut up, will you?!

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.030
Is she Emily?

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.770
She must be a pretty
important doll to you.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:12.270
Not just because there's a Mimic inside.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.480
It seems like there's something
more to her than that.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:17.480
It's nice to meet you, Emily.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:21.050
--Think she likes me?
--I don't know.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.850
Mind if I sit next to you?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.290
Do as you like.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.150
Yes!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.960
Oh... Those two look
pretty good together!

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.600
I've been wondering for a while now...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:41.770
Why do you suppose Sara-san's
Mimic is a doll?

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:45.340
That's because I modeled it after
a person, to help calm the mind

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:48.410
inside the cockpit, where you're
always staring death in the face!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.580
A partner you can commune with...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.250
That is the cornerstone
of a Mimic's existence!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.690
--More like it's just a creepy hobby.
--Shut up, Carmichael!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.950
It's your fault you have creepy hobbies!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.620
What?!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:04.590
I know! I'll rebuild your Mimics
especially for you, too!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:07.400
Okay! Who's first?! Come on!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.570
Uhh... Jessie!
Don't hold back to be polite!

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.330
Eh?!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.440
You, huh? You're a commendable girl!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:19.100
This won't hurt,
so just leave everything to me!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.380
N-no, thanks!
I'm not into that sort of thing!

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.540
Wait!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.520
Sheesh! What're they doing?

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.830
That guy...

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:16.130
May I have this dance, Miss?

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.100
With... me?

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:22.270
This is the second
of my very few talents.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:25.440
If you don't know how
to dance, I can lead.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:29.070
That's alright.
If the Box Step is okay with you.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:53.200
You're a good dancer.
Who taught you?

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.030
Sara?

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.880
What's wrong, Sara?

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.480
An enemy attack?

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.430
Status report.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:22.960
Yes, sir. TUMOR-like objects have
been detected in Hull Block F-34,

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.400
but there are no enemy ships present.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.240
So they snuck in
during that last battle...

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:32.370
We lost too much manpower
to cover the entire ship after all...

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.910
Combat Deployment #1!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.650
All personnel near F-34,
evacuate at once!

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.580
Use Gambees to
exterminate the TUMORs!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:40.620
We can't, sir!
None of the nearby trenches

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:42.780
have been repaired
since the last battle!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.410
Attacking them from
inside isn't possible!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.690
All Reasoners linked with their Mimics.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:58.830
All Strains, to launch positions.
All Strains, to launch positions.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.430
Increasing catapult output power.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.670
This isn't a simulation this time.
Don't do anything reckless.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:08.010
Understand?

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.550
Strain 01 and Strain EX.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:13.580
Secure the ship, and be ready
for any approaching enemies.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.450
Strain 01, Roger.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.390
Strain EX, Roger.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:21.120
All other Strains, find and
exterminate the TUMORs quickly.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:24.390
We may be decelerating,
but we're still at sub-light speed.

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:26.290
Make certain not to
let your guard down!

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:43.970
Come out, if you dare!

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:54.420
No TUMORs detected in Block F-34...

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:59.590
Come out already, ya damn TUMORs!

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:04.000
Hey, now. Are you sure it
wasn't just a false alarm?

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.940
There doesn't seem
to be anything here...

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:14.900
Can't we just go back now
and say we didn't find anything?

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:23.010
I found something not good...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:33.430
Please don't tell me they're
hiding in a place like this...

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:35.090
Eh?!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:49.040
What?! She's going off
on her own again?!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.050
Lavinia?!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.030
We can't get to Lavinia like this!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.570
N-no way!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.490
S- Sara-san!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:24.410
Whoa...

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:27.310
Those two make a great pair.

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:45.120
See, you can do it!
That was "zoom, bang-bang" just now!

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:57.510
Good work. We've detected
no approaching ships.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.340
You can come on back.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.640
Roger.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.910
You heard the man! Let's go back
and continue where we left off!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.010
Hurry, now!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:25.200
My brother... is just beyond there...

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.860
But...

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:44.550
Let's go back, Emily.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.370
"3rd 'Strain in Action' Party!!"

00:18:55.430 --> 00:19:01.170
And that is how they finally
convinced me to come to this school!

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.570
In fact, it would not be
an exaggeration to say

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.710
that this school exists
solely for my genius!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:08.230
--Yeah!
--Gutsy Girl and the Queen...

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.520
Sara-san!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.090
Thank you! I truly owe you my life!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.620
My heart is so full of feelings
of appreciation for you!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.190
Thank you so much!
Oh, are you hungry?

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:27.000
You are, aren't you? Hold on a second,
I'll go get you some food!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:31.000
Hey, you! Stop before you wind up
eating Sara's food too! Move!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:36.000
You told me about her, didn't you?

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.900
Thank you...

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:46.610
I'm not asking for a dance.
Just a handshake.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.130
Sara!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:08.590
You'd better hurry up
before it's all gone!

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.080
C'mon!

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:37.220
A clinging gaze. A stalking shadow.
A strange rumor spreads.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:41.690
On the next Soukou no Strain:
"Lavinia's Lovely Plot"

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.450
Help me, Emily!
